+- `design-evidence/question-card-and-qba-catalogue-bible.md`: original question-card grammar and four named QB-A editorial batches, including permitted sources, factual and accessibility/copy reviews, provenance, version/withdrawal fields, quotas, and non-copying expression evidence.
